  "description": "The text 'government limits you!!!' is juxtaposed with the visual of a line of police officers in riot gear, creating an analogical mapping where the authoritarian police force (visual entity) is mapped onto the concept of a government that limits citizens (textual entity). This mapping is central to the meme's intent, using the visual of oppressive state enforcement to represent the textual claim of government overreach, invoking the 'Soviet Amerika' concept to frame the argument.",
